data:{"id":"407622e7-1382-4efe-82e7-64344b8125a0","response_type":"tool_result","content":"Keyword search found 8 matching chunks across 4 document(s) (details omitted from history)","done":false,"data":{"display_type":"grep_results","document_count":4,"duration_ms":17,"error":"","knowledge_base_ids":["fed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581"],"knowledge_results":[{"chunk_hit_count":2,"distinct_patterns":1,"knowledge_base_id":"fed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581","knowledge_id":"ee9f60e3-062c-49cb-bad4-d8ccd3e8083c","knowledge_title":"native-passage-2","match_snippet":"... UNIX 是在许多不同类型的计算机上实现的多任务命令行操作系统。因为它既是独立操作系统又是网络操作系统，所以有人称 UNIX 为多用途操作系统。 Linux 是一种流行的、免费的、多任务的 UNIX 类型操作系统。 ...","pattern_counts":{"Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统":13},"title_match":false,"total_chunk_count":2,"total_pattern_hits":13},{"chunk_hit_count":2,"distinct_patterns":1,"knowledge_base_id":"fed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581","knowledge_id":"d4fdffd0-5c7d-4290-adbb-f5e1f7ae80b0","knowledge_title":"native-passage-3","match_snippet":"... Ubuntu 和 Mint 是最受欢迎的。如果您想在您的 PC 上安装非 Windows 操作系统并实际使用它，您可能应该选择 Linux。 Linux 是一个类 Unix 操作系统，还有其他开源操作系统，如 FreeBSD。 FreeBSD 使用不同的内核，但它使用的软件与您在典型的 Linux 发行版中可以找到的大部分软件相同。在台式 PC 上使用 FreeBSD 的体验将非常相似。铬操作系统。 ...","pattern_counts":{"Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统":13},"title_match":false,"total_chunk_count":2,"total_pattern_hits":13},{"chunk_hit_count":2,"distinct_patterns":1,"knowledge_base_id":"fed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581","knowledge_id":"95bc02d7-d130-4725-8e15-97455995ba58","knowledge_title":"native-passage-1","match_snippet":"... Mac 操作系统。 Mac OS 是 Apple Macintosh 操作系统的正式名称。 Mac OS 具有图形用户界面 (GUI)，该界面利用窗口、图标和运行在 Macintosh 计算机上的所有应用程序都具有类似的用户界面。 ...","pattern_counts":{"Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统":6},"title_match":false,"total_chunk_count":2,"total_pattern_hits":6},{"chunk_hit_count":2,"distinct_patterns":1,"knowledge_base_id":"fed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581","knowledge_id":"9286e345-411e-42bf-8083-02c97dac28b2","knowledge_title":"native-passage-4","match_snippet":"... DOS - 磁盘操作系统 - 个人计算机的首批操作系统之一。当您打开计算机时，您看到的只是看起来像 c:\\\u003e 的命令提示符。您必须在命令提示符下键入所有命令，这些命令可能类似于 c:\\\u003ewp\\wp.exe。这称为命令行界面。 ...","pattern_counts":{"Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统":5},"title_match":false,"total_chunk_count":2,"total_pattern_hits":5}],"limit":30,"max_results":30,"patterns":["Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统"],"queries":["Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统"],"query":"Windows|macOS|Mac OS|操作系统","result_count":8,"success":true,"tool_call_id":"call_205e6a2b3d894ebd89aa0125","tool_name":"grep_chunks","total_matches":8}}

